BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Halcyon HX-210 User Manual) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Document ID: prod-hx210-user-manual | Revision: F | Effective: 2025-06-16 | Owner: Halcyon) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 688 Td (Product Engineering, Leeds | Applies to firmware 3.4.1) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 663 Td (1. Safety information) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 641 Td (Read this manual in full before using the Halcyon HX-210 portable four-gas detector. The HX-210) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (is personal protective equipment. It warns the wearer of hazardous concentrations of oxygen) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (deficiency or enrichment, flammable gas, carbon monoxide \(CO\) and hydrogen sulphide \(H2S\). It) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (does not remove any hazard, and it cannot warn of gases for which it has no sensor fitted.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 580 Td (The HX-210 is certified intrinsically safe with the marking II 1G Ex ia IIC T4 Ga. It may be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 567 Td (used in Zone 0, Zone 1 and Zone 2 hazardous areas for gas groups IIA, IIB and IIC with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (temperature class T4. The ATEX certificate is Baseefa22ATEX0212X and the IECEx certificate is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 541 Td (IECEx BAS 22.0098X. The "X" suffix means special conditions of use apply; these are listed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 528 Td (below.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 506 Td (- Charge the instrument only in a safe \(non-hazardous\) area, using the HX-DOCK-4 docking) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 493 Td (   station or the supplied single-unit charger.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 480 Td (- Replace the battery pack HX-BAT-210 only in a safe area. Do not use any other battery) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 467 Td (   pack; the HX-BAT-220L pack from the HX-220 is not certified for the HX-210 and will not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 454 Td (   fit the housing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 441 Td (- Do not open the housing in a hazardous area.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 428 Td (- Do not rub or clean the front label with a dry cloth in a hazardous area; the label may) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 415 Td (   accumulate an electrostatic charge.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 402 Td (- Substitution of components may impair intrinsic safety.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 389 Td (- Perform a bump test before each day's use. Calibrate at least every 120 days, or sooner if) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 376 Td (   a bump test fails.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 363 Td (- High off-scale readings of flammable gas may indicate an explosive concentration. Leave) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 350 Td (   the area immediately.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 337 Td (- Oxygen-deficient atmospheres \(below approximately 10% vol O2\) can cause the catalytic LEL) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 324 Td (   sensor to read low.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 311 Td (- Silicones, leaded petrol vapours, sulphur compounds and halogenated hydrocarbons can) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 298 Td (   poison the catalytic LEL sensor. See section 11 and error code E-117.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 282 Td (2. Product overview) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 260 Td (The Halcyon HX-210 is a compact portable detector that continuously monitors four gases at the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 247 Td (same time. It is the core model of the Halcyon family. The HX-200 is the single-gas H2S) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 234 Td (sibling, and the HX-220 adds Bluetooth LE, GPS, a man-down alarm and a larger battery.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 212 Td (The HX-210 is fitted with four sensors:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 190 Td (- Oxygen \(O2\): electrochemical, part number HX-SNS-O2-01, range 0-30% vol, resolution 0.1%) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 177 Td (   vol.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 164 Td (- Flammable gas \(LEL\): catalytic bead, part number HX-SNS-LEL-04, range 0-100% LEL,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 151 Td (   resolution 1% LEL, calibrated to methane \(CH4\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 138 Td (- Carbon monoxide \(CO\): electrochemical, part number HX-SNS-CO-03, range 0-500 ppm,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 125 Td (   resolution 1 ppm.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 112 Td (- Hydrogen sulphide \(H2S\): electrochemical, part number HX-SNS-H2S-02, range 0-200 ppm,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 99 Td (   resolution 1 ppm.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 86 Td (The instrument is a diffusion instrument. Gas reaches the sensors through the sensor grille on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 73 Td (the front face. The HX-210 does not support the optional sampling pump HX-PMP-22; for remote) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 60 Td (sampling use the HX-220.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
