BT /F1 10 Tf 54 720 Td (The housing is rated IP67 and weighs 330 g including the battery. Dimensions are 125 x 68 x 40) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 707 Td (mm. The operating temperature range is -20 to +55 C.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 682 Td (3. Package contents) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 660 Td (The HX-210 starter kit, part number HX-210-KIT-03, contains:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 638 Td (- 1 x HX-210 detector with four sensors fitted and calibrated at the factory) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 625 Td (- 1 x HX-BAT-210 rechargeable Li-ion battery pack, 3,400 mAh \(fitted\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 612 Td (- 1 x single-unit USB-C charger with UK, EU, US and Type G/Type M plug adapters) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 599 Td (- 1 x calibration cap HX-CAP-210 with 1 m hose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 586 Td (- 1 x stainless steel belt clip with fixing screws) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 573 Td (- 1 x printed quick-start guide \(see also prod-hx210-quick-start\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 560 Td (- 1 x factory calibration certificate) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 547 Td (Calibration gas and regulators are not included. The HX-210 requires calibration gas) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 534 Td (MI-CAL-Q4-B and the 1.0 L/min regulator MI-REG-10. The older mix MI-CAL-Q4-A and the 0.5 L/min) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 521 Td (regulator MI-REG-05 are no longer approved for HX-210 calibration; see section 9.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 496 Td (4. Controls and indicators) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 474 Td (The HX-210 has one large push button on the front \(the ON/OK button\) and two smaller buttons) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 461 Td (below the display \(UP and DOWN\).) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 439 Td (- ON/OK: press and hold for 3 seconds to switch on. Press and hold for 5 seconds to switch) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 426 Td (   off \(a countdown is shown\). Short press to confirm a menu selection or to acknowledge a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 413 Td (   latched alarm.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 400 Td (- UP: short press to scroll up or increase a value. Press and hold in measuring mode to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 387 Td (   display peak readings.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 374 Td (- DOWN: short press to scroll down or decrease a value. Press and hold in measuring mode to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 361 Td (   display STEL and TWA values.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 348 Td (Indicators:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 326 Td (- Two red high-intensity LEDs on the top edge flash during alarms.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 313 Td (- A green LED flashes once every 10 seconds to confirm correct operation \(the "heartbeat" or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 300 Td (   confidence signal\). The interval can be changed between 5, 10 and 30 seconds in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 287 Td (   supervisor menu.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 274 Td (- A yellow LED lights when the calibration or bump test is overdue.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 261 Td (- The sounder produces 95 dB at 30 cm.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 248 Td (- A vibration motor operates in parallel with the sounder.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 232 Td (5. Charging and power-on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 210 Td (Charge the HX-210 fully before first use. A full charge from empty takes approximately 5 hours) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 197 Td (at 20 C. A fully charged HX-BAT-210 pack gives a typical runtime of 14 hours at 20 C with no) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 184 Td (alarms. Runtime is reduced at low temperature and during alarms; at -20 C expect approximately) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 171 Td (9 hours.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 149 Td (To charge, place the instrument in the HX-DOCK-4 docking station or connect the single-unit) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 136 Td (charger to the USB-C port on the base. The battery icon animates while charging and shows a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 123 Td (solid full symbol when charging is complete. Charge only between 0 and +40 C.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 101 Td (Power-on sequence:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 79 Td (1. Press and hold ON/OK for 3 seconds. All LEDs light, the sounder beeps and the motor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 66 Td (   vibrates. Confirm that you saw, heard and felt each alarm.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
