stream
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (5. Charge the new pack fully before use. The real-time clock may need to be reset by docking.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 715 Td (11.6 Replacing sensors) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 693 Td (Sensor replacement is described in the Halcyon Sensor Replacement Procedure) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 680 Td (\(sup-hx-sensor-replacement-procedure\). A full calibration is required after any sensor is) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 667 Td (replaced.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 642 Td (12. Supervisor settings) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 620 Td (The supervisor menu is protected by a four-digit passcode. The factory default supervisor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 607 Td (passcode for the HX-210 is 2107. Change it on commissioning using Menu > Supervisor > Security) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 594 Td (> Change Passcode. After five incorrect passcode entries the supervisor menu is locked for 10) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 581 Td (minutes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 559 Td (Supervisor settings include:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 537 Td (- Alarm set points and latching \(Menu > Supervisor > Alarms\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 524 Td (- Calibration interval, 30 to 120 days \(Menu > Supervisor > Calibration > Interval\). From) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 511 Td (   firmware 3.4.1 the HX-210 will not accept a calibration interval above 120 days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 498 Td (- Bump test interval and "bump before use" enforcement \(Menu > Supervisor > Bump\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 485 Td (- Datalog interval and overwrite \(Menu > Supervisor > Datalog\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 472 Td (- Confidence beep and heartbeat LED interval \(Menu > Supervisor > Indicators\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 459 Td (- Instrument name and user name, up to 16 characters \(Menu > Supervisor > Identity\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 446 Td (- Stealth mode, which disables the confidence beep and heartbeat LED but never the alarm) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 433 Td (   sounder) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 420 Td (If the supervisor passcode is lost, it can be reset from Meridian Link \(Instruments > Security) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 407 Td (> Reset Passcode\) by a user with the Fleet Administrator role. It cannot be reset from the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 394 Td (instrument itself.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 369 Td (13. Troubleshooting) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 347 Td (When the HX-210 detects a fault it shows an error code in the form E-1nn and sounds a fault) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 334 Td (tone \(three short beeps every 30 seconds\). The full list of codes, their meaning, the models) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 321 Td (they apply to and the corrective action is in the Halcyon Error Code Reference \(document ID) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 308 Td (sup-halcyon-error-codes\). The most common codes on the HX-210 are:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 286 Td (- E-101: sensor not detected. Reseat the sensor.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 273 Td (- E-104: span calibration failed. Check the cylinder and repeat calibration.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 260 Td (- E-108: calibration overdue.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 247 Td (- E-117: LEL sensor poisoned or bridge fault. Replace the LEL sensor; do not attempt to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 234 Td (   recalibrate.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 221 Td (- E-126: real-time clock lost.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 208 Td (Other symptoms:) Tj ET
BT /F2 9 Tf 54 187 Td (Symptom | Likely cause | Action) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 175 Td (Instrument will not switch on | Battery fully discharged | Charge for at least 30 minutes, then) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 163 Td (try again) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 151 Td (Slow response to bump gas | Blocked dust membrane | Replace HX-MEM-210 \(section 11.2\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 139 Td (O2 reads below 20.9% in fresh air | O2 sensor ageing | Zero in fresh air; check sensor life) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 127 Td (\(section 11.3\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 115 Td (LEL reads negative in clean air | Temperature change since zero | Allow 10 minutes to) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 103 Td (stabilise, then zero) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 91 Td (Instrument does not communicate with dock | Dock firmware older than D-2.1.0 | Update dock) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 54 79 Td (firmware \(see prod-halcyon-docking-station-guide\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 57 Td (If a fault cannot be resolved, raise a ticket in the Meridian Support Centre) Tj ET
endstream
