BT /F1 10 Tf 54 250 Td (40% and 60% and recharge it every 3 months. A pack stored fully discharged for more than 6) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 237 Td (months may be permanently damaged and will show E-111 when next charged.) Tj ET
