BT /F1 10 Tf 54 189 Td (calibrated before use, because the calibration countdown continues during storage.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11 Tf 54 166 Td (15.2 Transport) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 144 Td (The HX-BAT-210 is a lithium-ion battery with a rating below 100 Wh. When the pack is installed) Tj ET
