BT /F1 10 Tf 54 118 Td (under the applicable IATA packing instruction. Spare packs shipped separately must be protected) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 105 Td (against short circuit and must not exceed 30% state of charge for air freight. Instruments) Tj ET
